    "short_description": "Speed up and powerslide through twisty corners in this minimalistic arcade racer. No braking required. Stay on the throttle and feel the adrenaline of highspeed drifting. Race against AI, leaderboard ghosts or friends online or in split screen. Easy to learn, hard to master!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cStar Drift Evolution is without any doubt one of the best racing games of recent years... Pure counter steer driving bliss!\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 <br><br>\u201cThe Discord community is great and the game shines thanks to its easy to learn, hard to master gameplay!\u201d<br>8.2/10 \u2013 Tom's Hardware<br><br>\u201cThe different terrains are great and compared to other competitors Star Drift Evolution is the best value-for-money racing game you can buy today!\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Gamesurf<br>",
